  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-view qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-p1RgoWI7\">相关链接：</p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-oFZgnWmP\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-9t4VHtlH\"><a href=\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/openapi/doc/index.html?id=1696710720565248\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\">获取穿山甲流量包</a></li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-alLG50GC\"><a href=\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/openapi/doc/index.html?id=1696710721249295\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\">创建穿山甲流量包</a></li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-YYtYr6ab\"><a href=\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/openapi/doc/index.html?id=1696710721833984\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\">修改穿山甲流量包</a></li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-ClfEwWot\"><a href=\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/openapi/doc/index.html?id=1696710722514956\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\">删除穿山甲流量包</a></li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-saHYXqPj\"><a href=\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/openapi/doc/index.html?id=1696710723136512\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\">查看rit数据</a></li></ul><hr style=\"background-color: rgb(232, 232, 232); border: 1px solid transparent; margin: 18px 0px;\"/><p data-id=\"p838747a-A9EyxYiF\">穿山甲精选流量包，通过行业首创的独家双向建模，结合转化行为，挖掘行业优质流量，助力客户后端效果提升： 1、适用行业：应用软件&amp;游戏 2、营销目的：APP应用&amp;落地页-应用下载 3、投放范围：穿山甲直投计划（激励视频/原生信息流/开屏-竞价）</p><div class=\"qz-card-type-block\" data-type=\"qzcard\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22borderColor%22%3A%22%23fed4a4%22%2C%22backgroundColor%22%3A%22%23fff5eb%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22%3Cp%20data-id%3D%5C%22p838747a-cV5iOHLK%5C%22%3E%E6%B8%B8